      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TYPHOON SASKIA (7) was out of in the placings when fifth last time but three runs back produced a swift 19.61 win over 352m at Q Lakeside. Smart win three back and looks a key chance here. RUBY SLIPPER (4) looks close to another win after finishing second from Box 2 last time (19.20) at Q Straight. Expected to be in this for a long way. JADE CLOVER (2) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at her last five runs. Last start finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on September 16 over 366m at this track behind Hara's Dolly beaten 0.8 lengths (19.80). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Racing well and deserves a win. TOMMY'S AVA (6) is must include on her scintillating 17.94 win last start.",
